      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Colonia_Roma",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Walking its streets, visitors see restored early‑1900s architecture mixed with modern murals, boutique shops, and cafés that blend traditional Mexican and cosmopolitan vibes.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
